DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nSave the date now for our in-perso
 n September meetup!\n\nProgramming details are coming soon\, but for now h
 ere is the temporary info:\n\n**Date:** Tuesday evening\, September 8\n\n*
 *Time:**\nDoors open at 6:00 pm for networking and food and beverages\, li
 ve programming begins at 6:30 sharp.\n\n**Speaker and Topic:** Coming soon
 \n\n**Venue Location & Directions:**\nLocation: Fidelity Investments\, Dur
 ham\, NC\n[[https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/maps/VGu
 89aYsn8qt5xqa6)]([https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/ma
 ps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6))\nIf you enter “Select Dr\, Durham\, NC” into yo
 ur navigation it will take you to the parking lot access road and then jus
 t follow the signs to Visitor parking and then to the building we will be 
 meeting in. Once you have arrived at the Guest Parking area\, proceed to t
 he large building on the left.\n\n**Parking:** [[https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89
 aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6)]([https://goo.gl/maps
 /VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6](https://goo.gl/maps/VGu89aYsn8qt5xqa6))\n\n**Registrat
 ion and Government ID Required**\nPlease note\, security protocols onsite 
 require everyone attending to register ahead of time using your first and 
 last name as it appears on your government ID. **\\*Note\, by RSVP'ing for
  this meetup on [[Meetup.com](http://meetup.com/)]([http://meetup.com/](ht
 tp://meetup.com/)) you are "registering" for the event.**\n\n**You'll need
  to bring that ID with you to the event.**\nUpon entry you will be directe
 d to a table where your id will be checked and you will be given your pre-
 registered nametag and you will be escorted into the event space. This wil
 l help speed you through the lobby and get you to the food\, swag\, and co
 ntent without delay.\n\n**Questions?** Contact us at [info@allthingsopen.o
 rg.](http://info@allthingsopen.org./)\n\n**RSVP required**\n\\*This is a f
 ree event. However\, an RSVP is required. Seating is limited\, so RSVP's w
 ill be capped as we fill up. Please move quickly and RSVP to save your spo
 t if interested. When you RSVP you will be added to our mailing list to re
 ceive future event updates. You can unsubscribe at any time.
